I think in the recent version of NetHack there is something like this. It has
alignment similar to Dungeons & Dragons (the RPG), and you have a luck score
(which you don't know) and an 'alignment to your god' which is sometimes
revealled to you. Various actions eg stealing from shops if lawful, attacking
tame creatures if lawful, etc affect these numbers. Also exercise makes you
stronger, disabling traps more dexterous, etc.

Note: this is all based on vague memories from rec.games.hack, which I stopped
reading some time ago when the volume got stupid after the latest release. I'm
cross-posting there to invite comments... Follow-ups are to rec.games.int-fiction
please note.

